    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "Primary account is framed as dreams/visions rather than a self NDE: (a) a 'tug of war' dream with three pulls that the experiencer later correlates with the patient's being coded three times; (b) a second dream where a hallway becomes a forest and a distant light becomes the patient's healthy form, who communicates a message for his wife; additional reports include childhood 'shadow people' called 'Lolo's' and the experiencer's hospice mother describing a tunnel and a figure/child named 'Lolo'.",
      "notable_quotes": "“They coded him three times… and he and I did three ‘pulls’ in our tug of war in my dream!”; “I then see off in the distance a light coming towards me. As it got closer, it became a form, then the body of my patient!”; “I just wanted to thank you for taking such good care of me. Please tell my wife how much I love her and I am sorry I was such a burden”; “He’s standing next to this tunnel and he wants me to go into it with him”; “He said his name is Lolo.”"
